<rss version="2.0" xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/"><channel><title>救生艇新闻：博客——保护人类</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/</link><description></description><lastBuildDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:44:20 GMT</lastBuildDate><generator>rfeed v1.1.1</generator><docs>https://github.com/svpino/rfeed/blob/master/README.md</docs><item><title>在俘获离子和超导硬件上对可调谐量子神经网络进行基准测试</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/benchmarking-a-tunable-quantum-neural-network-on-trapped-ion-and-superconducting-hardware</link><description>通过使用两个量子计算平台实现量子神经网络，研究人员已采取措施确定此类系统是否能够可靠地实现其理论承诺。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/benchmarking-a-tunable-quantum-neural-network-on-trapped-ion-and-superconducting-hardware2.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:44:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/benchmarking-a-tunable-quantum-neural-network-on-trapped-ion-and-superconducting-hardware</guid></item><item><title>暗数据 IIoT 机会隐藏在您已经拥有的文件中</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-dark-data-iiot-opportunity-is-hiding-in-files-you-already-own</link><description>大多数制造商都错过了物联网中的暗数据机会。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/the-dark-data-iiot-opportunity-is-hiding-in-files-you-already-own.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:29:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/the-dark-data-iiot-opportunity-is-hiding-in-files-you-already-own</guid></item><item><title>科学家可能已经逆转了衰老的原因之一登月计划</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-may-have-reversed-one-cause-of-aging-moonshots</link><description>&lt;img src="https://politepaul.com/fd/dtDF30237DhP.xml" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 00:14:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-may-have-reversed-one-cause-of-aging-moonshots</guid></item><item><title>我们正处于终结衰老的边缘吗？</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/are-we-on-the-brink-of-ending-aging</link><description>秘密科学。亿万富翁的支持者。在疯狂的追求中，让变老成为过去。&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/are-we-on-the-brink-of-ending-aging.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 23:59:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/are-we-on-the-brink-of-ending-aging</guid></item><item><title>可穿戴式超声波贴片无需药物或手术即可促进快速眼动睡眠</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/wearable-ultrasound-patch-boosts-rem-sleep-without-drugs-or-surgery</link><description>快速眼动睡眠中断与抑郁、焦虑和创伤后应激障碍 (PTSD) 有关。目前解决睡眠问题的方法，包括药物和行为疗法，可能会引起副作用，或者可能无法直接解决干扰快速眼动睡眠的潜在因素。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/wearable-ultrasound-patch-boosts-rem-sleep-without-drugs-or-surgery.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 23:44:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/wearable-ultrasound-patch-boosts-rem-sleep-without-drugs-or-surgery</guid></item><item><title>佛罗里达州一名潜水员在潜水超过 20,000 次后，建造了一个水下苗圃，为濒临死亡的珊瑚礁培育了 25,000 颗受威胁的珊瑚</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-florida-diver-after-more-than-20000-dives-built-an-underwater-nursery-that-grew-25000-threatened-corals-for-dying-reefs</link><description>佛罗里达州的堡礁是美国唯一的活珊瑚堡礁，也是世界第三大堡礁系统，沿着佛罗里达州的堡礁，海洋科学家和沿海社区目睹了数十年的严重生态崩溃。广泛的珊瑚白化、海面温度上升、海洋酸化以及石珊瑚组织损失病等传染性疾病已大大减少了佛罗里达群岛历史上的活珊瑚覆盖率。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/a-florida-diver-after-more-than-20000-dives-built-an-underwater-nursery-that-grew-25000-threatened-corals-for-dying-reefs.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 23:29:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/a-florida-diver-after-more-than-20000-dives-built-an-underwater-nursery-that-grew-25000-threatened-corals-for-dying-reefs</guid></item><item><title>科学家在南极洲追踪了 12 个人 10 个月——所发生的事情可能会影响未来的火星任务</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-tracked-12-people-in-antarctica-for-10-months-what-happened-could-shape-future-mars-missions</link><description>一项为期十个月的南极实验发现，宇航员不仅可能会与孤独作斗争，而且还会与花太多时间和同一个人在一起而苦苦挣扎。频繁的接触会导致更大的紧张和不信任，而船员们也越来越分成基于文化和语言的群体。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/scientists-tracked-12-people-in-antarctica-for-10-months-what-happened-could-shape-future-mars-missions.webp" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 23:14:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/scientists-tracked-12-people-in-antarctica-for-10-months-what-happened-could-shape-future-mars-missions</guid></item><item><title>大文件支持</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/large-file-support</link><description>19 年前我购买了一些软件的版本 6。我在大约 17 年没有使用它之后又开始使用它，它的版本是 26，我的旧注册仍然有效，所以我仍然拥有专业版！他们甚至不再出售该软件，他们只是租用它，但他们尊重我以前购买的产品！&lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/large-file-support.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 22:59:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/large-file-support</guid></item><item><title>Samsara 的内部销售对 IIoT 来说真正意味着什么</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/what-samsaras-insider-selling-really-signals-for-iiot</link><description>Samsara 内部人士在过去一年中净售出 5700 万美元，其中包括首席执行官兼董事会成员马克·安德森 (Marc Andreessen) 的主要出售——而分析师的报道仍然强烈看好。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/what-samsaras-insider-selling-really-signals-for-iiot.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 22:44:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/what-samsaras-insider-selling-really-signals-for-iiot</guid></item><item><title>药物在数小时内暂时逆转成年小鼠类似自闭症的大脑变化</title><link>https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/drug-temporarily-reverses-autism-like-brain-changes-in-adult-mice-within-hours</link><description>加州大学洛杉矶分校健康中心领导的一项新的小鼠研究表明，怀孕期间的炎症可能会引发后代的自闭症样变化，但这些大脑和行为影响可能会在成年后通过单剂量的免疫抑制药物雷帕霉素迅速逆转，尽管是暂时的。 &lt;img src="https://lifeboat.com/blog.images/drug-temporarily-reverses-autism-like-brain-changes-in-adult-mice-within-hours.jpg" /&gt;由 PolitePaul 服务提供</description><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 22:29:18 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="true">https://lifeboat.com/blog/2026/08/drug-temporarily-reverses-autism-like-brain-changes-in-adult-mice-within-hours</guid></item></channel></rss>